  Discard the pending handoff?
  Starting another fresh chat removes this in-memory handoff plan.

› 1. Keep the pending handoff  Return to this fresh session.
  2. Discard and clear         Start another fresh chat without the plan.

  Press enter to confirm or esc to go back
